# The forms of the relative marker that agree with a month name, which is a
# masculine singular noun (DIEC2 (IEC): gener, febrer ... are listed as m.).
# Only these close the year phrase of a part of a month as a lone trailing
# marker ("fin janvier dernier"); another form agrees with the word after it
# ("dernière minute", "pasada la fecha") and is left over. Invariant forms are
# kept.
passat
anterior
últim
ultim
proper
pròxim
proxim
que ve
següent
vinent
aquest
